 "finding": "Paired A/B on Apple M3 Ultra layer 3, loadavg { 7.53 6.09 6.14 }. weight_codes 50% drop -18292 ns for 33423360 unique bytes (ON the critical path, 0.547282 ms/GB, billing 1827.21 GB/s unique). broadcast_aux 50% drop -126 ns for 8355840 unique bytes (within_noise=True; NOT billed at the organ average). activation 50% drop -25959 ns for 55296 unique x bytes (probe_on_critical_path=True; catalog state/activation bills at the organ average 344.1 GB/s because the unique-x rate does not transfer to 100 MB+ tensors). A candidate that does not declare a stream class is refused.",
 "geometry": "geo_tpr64_tg128",
